        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST \r\n\r\n**** SUPER 3 BEDROOM HOUSE ***** RECENTLY REFURBISHED THROUGHOUT ***** 3 X DOUBLE BEDROOMS ***** FULLY FURNISHED **** AVAILABLE NOW! \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this beautiful spacious three-bedroom, one-bathroom house to the rental market in the highly sought-after Avonmore Grove, Tallaght, Dublin 24. This well-presented property is situated within a mature and established residential development and has been recently Decorated / Re-furbished throughout. The property is ideally located close to a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, parks, leisure facilities and transport links. The accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a bright and spacious living room, a fully fitted kitchen with dining area, 3 X Double Bedrooms and a main family bathroom. To the rear, the property boasts a spacious private back garden with a Large Shed which can be used for various uses. The Property Boasts Gas Fired Central Heating, 3 X Double Bedrooms, Large Shed to the Rear, Ample Parking to the front. \r\n\r\nExtra Features:\r\nBeautiful 3 Bed / 1 Bath House\r\nFully Furnished\r\n3 X Double Bedrooms \r\nSpacious and well-presented throughout\r\nRecently decorated & Re-furbished\r\nNew Carpets laid throughout \r\nSpacious Lounge with Log Burner Fire \r\nFully fitted Modern Kitchen with all Mod-Cons\r\nFully Tiled Bathroom \r\nPrivate low maintenance rear garden with Large Shed\r\nMature and sought-after residential location \r\nExcellent local amenities nearby \r\nConvenient public transport links \r\nEasy access to major road networks including N81 &M50\r\nAvailable now \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST EMAIL ENQUIRES ONLY PLEASE"
